# Preserve bytes exactly. Do NOT normalise line endings.
#
# Two reasons this matters here:
#  1. MANIFEST.sha256 is the vendor's integrity list and our only way to identify
#     which files we have patched. Any line-ending conversion changes every hash
#     and makes that comparison useless.
#  2. Several parsers in this app are line-ending sensitive (see PATCHES.md #5).
* -text
